message: "Cite this unrefereed candidate and preserve its assurance qualifications."
title: "Untouched subsets and a counterexample to the Nestoridi–Yan biased-transposition limit-profile conjecture"
authors:
  - name: Anonymous
version: 1.0.1-candidate
date-released: 2026-09-11
license:
  - CC0-1.0
