repository-code: https://github.com/ipitchford/biased-transposition-profile-counterexample
keywords:
  - random transpositions
  - Markov-chain mixing
  - limit profile
  - total variation
  - counterexample
abstract: >-
  An unrefereed candidate proof that the equal-half limit-profile formula in
  Nestoridi and Yan, arXiv:2409.16387v1, is false, together with a general
  deterministic-subset lower bound and exact finite certificates. The general
  t_mix = t_star + O(n) upper-bound problem remains open.
  Original prose and research data are CC0-1.0; original code is MIT.
  Inherited inputs retain NOASSERTION and are not relicensed; see LICENSES.md.
